{#
  SITEWIDE SECTIONS CATALOG
  =========================
  This page serves as a living component library for all reusable sections.

  Purpose:
  - Document all available sections with live examples
  - Provide reference for content editors
  - Enable easy handoff to WordPress/other platforms

  Maintained by: /section-catalog agent

  Categories:
  - Hero: Full-width hero/banner sections
  - Layout: Multi-column layouts, content splits
  - Cards: Card grids, event cards, location cards
  - Content: Text-heavy sections, timelines, FAQs
  - Media: Image galleries, video sections
  - CTA: Call-to-action sections
  - Forms: Contact forms, newsletter signups
  - Navigation: Headers, footers (reference only)
#}

