    <article class="sitewide-sections__item">
      <header class="sitewide-sections__item-header">
        <h3>.quick-links</h3>
        <p>Section with eyebrow, heading, and a 3-column grid of image cards. Each card has a photo, dark teal bottom bar with title, description, and arrow link. Grey background with hover lift effect. If any field is not filled out, that element is hidden.</p>
