          <dt>Icon Color:</dt>
          <dd>Selectable from style guide colors (default: --color-cirrus)</dd>
          <dt>Animation:</dt>
          <dd>counterUp on scroll</dd>
          <dt>Conditional:</dt>
          <dd>All fields — if empty, element is hidden</dd>
        </dl>
      </header>
      <div class="sitewide-sections__example">
        {% include "impact-stats.njk" %}
      </div>
    </article>

