        <h3>.testimonial-section</h3>
        <p>Full-width section with a centered testimonial card: large quote mark, blockquote text, and attribution. Card background color is optional/configurable (defaults to --color-sand). Set via variables before include: <code>testimonialQuote</code>, <code>testimonialAttribution</code>, <code>testimonialBg</code>.</p>
        <dl class="sitewide-sections__meta">
          <dt>Fields:</dt>
          <dd>Quote (req, rich text), Attribution (optional — name + title), Background color (optional, palette — default --color-sand)</dd>
          <dt>Children:</dt>
          <dd>.testimonial-card, .quote-icon, blockquote, .attribution</dd>
          <dt>Conditional:</dt>
          <dd>Attribution + custom background — hidden/default if empty</dd>
        </dl>
