    <!-- ============================================
         SECTION: Media Kit
         Category: Content
         Description: Resource hub — download buttons, instructions, thumbnails
         Modifiers: button layout --single / --grid
         ============================================ -->
    <article class="sitewide-sections__item">
      <header class="sitewide-sections__item-header">
        <h3>.media-kit</h3>
        <p>A resource hub built from stacked, centered sections (one per topic, e.g. Logos, Guidelines, Tin Cup Challenge). Each section has a heading (also its anchor id), optional rich text, and any of: download buttons, numbered instructions, or a grid of downloadable image thumbnails. Repeat the section block as needed.</p>
        <dl class="sitewide-sections__meta">
          <dt>Per section:</dt>
          <dd>Heading (req, = anchor id), Body text (optional, supports mailto:/file links)</dd>
          <dt>Buttons:</dt>
          <dd>Repeater — layout --single (one primary CTA) or --grid (file links, PDF icon)</dd>
          <dt>Instructions:</dt>
          <dd>Repeater — numbered steps (optional)</dd>
          <dt>Thumbnails:</dt>
          <dd>Gallery — 240x240 PNG, each a download link with label (optional)</dd>
          <dt>Conditional:</dt>
          <dd>Any of body/buttons/instructions/thumbnails — hidden if empty</dd>
        </dl>
